@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title A12 已确认类设计 · 开发测试与离线验证\n总体、具体类及值契约均已确认
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
package "离线验证 · 三个PowerShell函数模块" {
  class ValidationOrchestrator <<script module>> {
    ValidationPlan / StageProgress
    +New-ValidationPlan()
    +Invoke-ValidationStage()
    +Import-LinuxStage()
    +Complete-Validation()
  }
  class ValidationProcessRunner <<script module>> {
    +Start-ValidationProcess()
    +Wait-ValidationProcess()
    +Stop-OwnedProcess()
  }
  class ValidationEvidence <<script module>> {
    +New-ContentManifest()
    +Read-NativeReport()
    +Verify-StageEvidence()
    +Import-ManualObservation()
    +Import-ExperienceFeedback()
    +Evaluate-Acceptance()
    +Write-ValidationSummary()
  }
}
package "开发测试 · 同一个 UEgame Runtime 模块" {
  abstract FAutomationTestBase <<UE>>
  interface IAutomationLatentCommand <<UE>> {
    +Update() : bool
  }
  class FExperimentCoreContractTest <<macro generated>> {
    +GetTests()
    +RunTest(CaseId)
  }
  class FExperimentWorldScenarioTest <<macro generated>> {
    +GetTests()
    +RunTest(CaseId)
  }
  class FRunExperimentScenarioCommand {
    +Update() : bool
  }
  class FExperimentScenarioDriver {
    Weak World / Director / Controller
    CaseIdentity / Deadline / Evidence
    +Begin()
    +Pump()
    +BeginCleanup()
    +PumpCleanup()
    +CaptureOutcome()
  }
}
package "核心检查工具 · UE模块外 Tests" {
  class CoreCaseSupport <<free functions / values>> {
    CoreCaseSpec / CoreCaseOutcome
    +ListCoreCases()
    +RunCoreCase(CaseId)
  }
  class CoreChecksMain <<Linux executable entry>>
}
class "既有世界唯一所有者\nSubsystem / Director / 各领域组件" as world <<existing>>
class "已有 ExperimentSession / 规则\n无可写RunState暴露" as core <<existing>>
class "人工观察 / 本人反馈\n包内试听、原话、两项评价\n关联BuildId与RunId" as human <<records>>
ValidationOrchestrator --> ValidationProcessRunner : 明确阶段调用
ValidationOrchestrator --> ValidationEvidence : 回执与证据校验
ValidationProcessRunner ..> CoreChecksMain : Linux本地执行 / 回收证据
ValidationProcessRunner ..> FExperimentWorldScenarioTest : 启动UE宿主及测试请求
ValidationProcessRunner ..> FExperimentCoreContractTest
ValidationEvidence ..> human : 校验关联，不代填体验
FAutomationTestBase <|-- FExperimentCoreContractTest
FAutomationTestBase <|-- FExperimentWorldScenarioTest
IAutomationLatentCommand <|.. FRunExperimentScenarioCommand
FExperimentWorldScenarioTest --> FRunExperimentScenarioCommand : 排入框架队列
FRunExperimentScenarioCommand *-- FExperimentScenarioDriver : 每Case一份
FExperimentScenarioDriver --> world : 既有入口 / 只读采样
FExperimentCoreContractTest --> CoreCaseSupport
CoreChecksMain --> CoreCaseSupport
CoreCaseSupport --> core : 正常纯值接口
note bottom of FExperimentScenarioDriver
  普通C++类，无独立Tick，不拥有玩法状态。
  失败也先清理；Update=true只表示命令结束。
end note
note bottom of ValidationEvidence
  进程成功、用例成功、本人体验分开判断。
  JSON与Markdown由同一组已核验证据生成。
end note
legend bottom
  四个开发测试类；三个外部脚本模块不是游戏C++类。
  Tests/Shared是值与自由函数，不新增运行时管理器。
  所有具体接口均已确认；没有执行构建或测试。
endlegend
@enduml
